softwares, client database and dealings details, and various other electronic records,
documents, data, information of the Plaintiff No.1 available in any form with the Defendants, NC: 2026:KHC:13945 HC-KAR its officers, servants, agents,
representatives, contractors and assigns, sister concerns and any other person working for and on behalf of the Defendants, to the authorized representative of the Plaintiffs;
f) An order for rendition of accounts of the Defendants to show the unjust profit which the Defendants have derived through illegal and wrongful means which have caused loss to the Plaintiff and subsequently an order for damages on the basis of the rendition of accounts.
